Act II: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Juliet and Othello]
Juliet:
 Am I better than Othello?
 If so, let us proceed to scene III.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Miranda and Shylock]
Miranda:
 You are as good as Macbeth.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Miranda and Falstaff]
Miranda:
 You are as good as the sum of the difference between Juliet and Romeo and a hero.
 Let us proceed to scene IV.

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Miranda and Shylock]
