[Exeunt]
[Enter Miranda and Falstaff]
Miranda:
 You are as good as the difference between Juliet and Othello.

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Miranda and Horatio]
Miranda:
